  <section
    id="features"
    class="section possibilities-section"
    aria-labelledby="possibilities-heading"
  >
    <div class="container possibilities-layout">
      <div class="section-intro feature-intro">
        <h2 id="possibilities-heading">More than pressing play.</h2>
      </div>
      <div
        class="possibilities-grid"
        role="region"
        aria-label="Featured plugins"
        tabindex="0"
      >
        <article>
          <h3>Everyone gets a turn with Party mode.</h3>
          <p>
            Guests scan a QR code to browse your music and request songs from
            their phones. You decide what plays next. No app or account needed.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/plugins/party/">
            Explore Party mode
          </a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Challenge your friends with Music Quiz.</h3>
          <p>
            Turn your collection into game night. Guess the song, put tracks in
            order of release or try music trivia. Friends join from their
            phones.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/plugins/music-quiz/">
            Explore Music Quiz
          </a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Sing along with the music you love.</h3>
          <p>
            Follow the lyrics in Now Playing. When timed lyrics are available,
            they scroll along with the music.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/metadata/lyrics/">
            Explore lyrics
          </a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Create a radio station of your own.</h3>
          <p>
            Give your playlist an AI host that introduces songs and adds weather
            or news between tracks. Set the personality and how often it speaks.
            You can use the AI and text-to-speech services you already have in
            Home Assistant.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/plugins/ai-radio/">
            Explore AI Radio
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link all-plugins-link" href="/plugins/">
        All plugins <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="experience" class="section discover-section">
    <div class="container discover-layout">
      <div class="discover-copy">
        <h2>Get lost in the music.</h2>
        <p>
          Browse new releases, rediscover favorites and find what to play next
          without jumping between apps.
        </p>
        <p>
          Build smart playlists that follow your own rules, or find songs that
          sound like a favorite.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="discover-image">
        <img
          src="/assets/landing/discover-page.webp"
          alt="Music Assistant Discover page with personalized picks, new tracks and albums"
          width="800"
          height="435"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="setlist" class="section setlist-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="setlist-heading">
        <div>
          <h2>Fine-tune your everyday listening.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="setlist" data-accordion>
        <article class="track is-open">
          <button
            class="track-trigger"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="true"
            aria-controls="track-1"
          >
            <span class="track-number">01</span>
            <span class="track-title">Move your playlists</span>
            <span class="track-summary">
              Take your favorites to another service.
            </span>
            <span class="track-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              −
            </span>
          </button>
          <div id="track-1" class="track-panel">
            <p>
              Copy playlists between supported services and keep them in sync as
              you add new songs.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="track">
          <button
            class="track-trigger"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="true"
            aria-controls="track-2"
          >
            <span class="track-number">02</span>
            <span class="track-title">Add Spotify Connect</span>
            <span class="track-summary">Keep using the Spotify app.</span>
            <span class="track-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              +
            </span>
          </button>
          <div id="track-2" class="track-panel">
            <p>
              Make supported speakers appear in Spotify, even if they didn’t
              come with Spotify Connect. Pick one speaker or a whole group in
              the Spotify app and play as usual.{" "}
              <a href="/plugins/spotify-connect/">Set up Spotify Connect</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="track">
          <button
            class="track-trigger"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="true"
            aria-controls="track-3"
          >
            <span class="track-number">03</span>
            <span class="track-title">
              The best sound each speaker can play
            </span>
            <span class="track-summary">
              Gapless albums, smoother transitions and consistent volume.
            </span>
            <span class="track-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              +
            </span>
          </button>
          <div id="track-3" class="track-panel">
            <p>
              Music Assistant matches the audio to what each speaker supports.
              Keep albums gapless, blend tracks with Smart Fades, even out
              volume between songs and adjust the sound for your speakers and
              room.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="track">
          <button
            class="track-trigger"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="true"
            aria-controls="track-4"
          >
            <span class="track-number">04</span>
            <span class="track-title">Different speakers in sync</span>
            <span class="track-summary">AirPlay meets Sendspin.</span>
            <span class="track-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              +
            </span>
          </button>
          <div id="track-4" class="track-panel">
            <p>
              Play your existing AirPlay speakers in sync with Sendspin devices
              as one group.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="track">
          <button
            class="track-trigger"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="true"
            aria-controls="track-5"
          >
            <span class="track-number">05</span>
            <span class="track-title">Let your home speak up</span>
            <span class="track-summary">
              Hear the message without losing your place.
            </span>
            <span class="track-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              +
            </span>
          </button>
          <div id="track-5" class="track-panel">
            <p>
              Give Home Assistant a voice through your speakers, from a doorbell
              alert to a call for dinner. Music Assistant pauses or lowers the
              music for the announcement, then brings it back when the message
              ends.{" "}
              <a href="/integration/announcements/">Set up announcements</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="track">
          <button
            class="track-trigger"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="true"
            aria-controls="track-6"
          >
            <span class="track-number">06</span>
            <span class="track-title">Search your whole library by voice</span>
            <span class="track-summary">Ask for the music and the room.</span>
            <span class="track-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              +
            </span>
          </button>
          <div id="track-6" class="track-panel">
            <p>
              Ask Home Assistant Assist to find a song, album, artist or
              playlist across your connected music sources, then tell it where
              to play. <a href="/integration/voice/">Set up voice control</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
